OL,3,GNEWSAHow to prepare yourself for when
OL,4,Aan emergency strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FHow would you prepare for an emergency?
OL,7,FHow would you cope? And what about your
OL,8,Frelatives, friends, neighbours and
OL,9,Fcolleagues?
OL,11,FThese are the questions the government
OL,12,Fwants people to ask themselves, as
OL,13,Femergency planners warn of growing
OL,14,Fthreats from heatwaves and flooding, as
OL,15,Fwell as potential cyber attacks by
OL,16,Fhostile states that could cripple vital
OL,17,Fenergy infrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
