OL,3,GNEWSAHow to prepare yourself for when
OL,4,Aan emergency strikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis summer's wildfires, which scorched
OL,7,Ffields in areas including Swallowfield
OL,8,Fin Berkshire, Abingdon in Oxfordshire,
OL,9,Fand forced the closure of the A31 in
OL,10,Fthe New Forest, have highlighted just
OL,11,Fhow vulnerable communities can be to
OL,12,Fnatural disasters.
OL,14,FThe government says there are a number
OL,15,Fof simple but effective steps everyone
OL,16,Fcan take to stay safe and better
OL,17,Fprepared should disaster strike.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
